~<rationale>{
  Chapter 23 measured from its canon. Ring 10 of 13, () scope: harmonic councils and scoped ensembles. Its rooms can be read as the stations of one line, in order; its twin an octave away is Chapter 10.
}

^"identity"{
  chapter: 23
  book: 2
