  metabolite: "warm tallow smoke, rosin dust on wooden geometry dividers, and unison humming"
  symbiotes: "night-school grown-ups learning geometric slices, pie-dividers measuring pi roughly by string"
  irritant: "the chalk circle stubbornly refusing to close evenly before dawn wipes the slate"
  circulation: "voices in tune hold a chord steady enough for shaky rulers to meet at center"
}

